    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000tkt2](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000tkt2) Magnitude 7.7 earthquake at 10.0 depth occurred on Aug 14 2026 29km NE of Mbay. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -8.3101 longitude 121.3517. It impacted 183300 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
